  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently fcrepo Docker image is built in 2 pipelines:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "The pipeline of fcrepo whenever a new releases has been created.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "The pipeline of fcrepo-docker (either triggered manually or by a commit to ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ],
           "text": "main",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": " or automatically based on a weekly schedule)",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "While researching for a solution for ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3913"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " I found a few interesting approaches that could simplify the current solution.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Main goals:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Only build fcrepo Docker image in pipeline of fcrepo-docker",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Don’t check out and build fcrepo when building the Docker image",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Automatically detect the latest releases.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For now this ticket is here as way for me to document the approaches. Resources:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Trigger pipeline from another repository:",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "content": [
            {
             "content": [
              {
               "attrs": {
                "url": "https://blog.marcnuri.com/triggering-github-actions-across-different-repositories"
               },
               "type": "inlineCard"
              }
             ],
             "type": "paragraph"
            }
           ],
           "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
           "content": [
            {
             "content": [
              {
               "attrs": {
                "url": "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/74775432/trigger-another-repo-in-github-actions"
               },
               "type": "inlineCard"
              },
              {
               "text": " ",
               "type": "text"
              }
             ],
             "type": "paragraph"
            }
           ],
           "type": "listItem"
          }
         ],
         "type": "bulletList"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Get latest release of fcrepo from Github releases with Bash/curl:",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "content": [
            {
             "content": [
              {
               "attrs": {
                "url": "https://fabianlee.org/2021/02/16/bash-determining-latest-github-release-tag-and-version/"
               },
               "type": "inlineCard"
              },
              {
               "text": " (corresponding releases API: ",
               "type": "text"
              },
              {
               "attrs": {
                "url": "https://docs.github.com/en/rest/releases/releases?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-the-latest-release"
               },
               "type": "inlineCard"
              },
              {
               "text": ")",
               "type": "text"
              }
             ],
             "type": "paragraph"
            }
           ],
           "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
           "content": [
            {
             "content": [
              {
               "text": " query available tags via Github API: ",
               "type": "text"
              },
              {
               "attrs": {
                "url": "https://docs.github.com/en/rest/git/refs?apiVersion=2022-11-28#list-matching-references"
               },
               "type": "inlineCard"
              },
              {
               "text": " ",
               "type": "text"
              }
             ],
             "type": "paragraph"
            }
           ],
           "type": "listItem"
          }
         ],
         "type": "bulletList"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Get releases from Github via API:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl --silent \"https://api.github.com/repos/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/releases\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Get latest release:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl --silent \"https://api.github.com/repos/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/releases/latest\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Extract tag name:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl --silent \"https://api.github.com/repos/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/releases/latest\" | jq \".tag_name\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Extract release number from tag name:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl --silent \"https://api.github.com/repos/REPO/releases/latest\" \\\\\n| jq \".tag_name\" \\\\\n| sed -E 's/^\"TAG_PREFIX-(.+)\"$/\\1/'",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
