  "description": "<p>Currently fcrepo Docker image is built in 2 pipelines:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>The pipeline of fcrepo whenever a new releases has been created.</li>\n\t<li>The pipeline of fcrepo-docker (either triggered manually or by a commit to <tt>main</tt> or automatically based on a weekly schedule)</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>While researching for a solution for <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3913\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3913</a> I found a few interesting approaches that could simplify the current solution.</p>\n\n<p>Main goals:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Only build fcrepo Docker image in pipeline of fcrepo-docker</li>\n\t<li>Don’t check out and build fcrepo when building the Docker image</li>\n\t<li>Automatically detect the latest releases.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n\n<p>For now this ticket is here as way for me to document the approaches. Resources:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Trigger pipeline from another repository:\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://blog.marcnuri.com/triggering-github-actions-across-different-repositories\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://blog.marcnuri.com/triggering-github-actions-across-different-repositories</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/74775432/trigger-another-repo-in-github-actions\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/74775432/trigger-another-repo-in-github-actions</a></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Get latest release of fcrepo from Github releases with Bash/curl:\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://fabianlee.org/2021/02/16/bash-determining-latest-github-release-tag-and-version/\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fabianlee.org/2021/02/16/bash-determining-latest-github-release-tag-and-version/</a> (corresponding releases API: <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/rest/releases/releases?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-the-latest-release\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://docs.github.com/en/rest/releases/releases?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-the-latest-release</a>)</li>\n\t\t<li>query available tags via Github API: <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/rest/git/refs?apiVersion=2022-11-28#list-matching-references\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://docs.github.com/en/rest/git/refs?apiVersion=2022-11-28#list-matching-references</a></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Get releases from Github via API:</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>curl --silent \"https://api.github.com/repos/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/releases\"</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>Get latest release:</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>curl --silent \"https://api.github.com/repos/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/releases/latest\"</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>Extract tag name:</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>curl --silent \"https://api.github.com/repos/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/releases/latest\" | jq \".tag_name\"</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>Extract release number from tag name:</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>curl --silent \"https://api.github.com/repos/REPO/releases/latest\" \\\\\n| jq \".tag_name\" \\\\\n| sed -E 's/^\"TAG_PREFIX-(.+)\"$/\\1/'</pre>\n</div></div>",
